{"note_id":"player-wufeng","previous":null,"history_index":0,"entry":{"at":"2026-11-13T14:01:13.133197+00:00","origin":"import","body":{"schema_version":6,"leading":"","nodes":[{"type":"heading","level":1,"title":"武凤","space":" ","separator":"\n\n","id":"n-687ac1c66401f8b42ed5"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"title":"技能","space":" ","separator":"\n\n","id":"n-3cc74abe48119da9ebbb"},{"type":"entry","key":"门庭赫奕","show_key":true,"value":"开局额外获得3点能量，每次拍卖后再获得3点能量。","prefix":"","key_suffix":"：","separator":"\n\n","id":"n-3dc9d341e37e2161a429"},{"type":"entry","key":"众心所归与为我所用","show_key":true,"value":"每使用45点能量获得一张为我所用。使用后随机获得本局其他棋手的一张秘技牌。","prefix":"","key_suffix":"：","separator":"\n\n","id":"n-b3c064851071819d80b2"},{"type":"entry","key":"万鸟朝凤","show_key":true,"value":"棋手6级可从随机提供的三名棋手的秘技牌中选择一张。","prefix":"","key_suffix":"：","separator":"\n\n","id":"n-b6fa03aef894538f2262"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"title":"前期思路","space":" ","separator":"\n\n","id":"n-9b8736adfc167663a2a9"},{"type":"entry","key":"正文","show_key":false,"value":"优先用额外能量补能赢下战斗的过渡英雄，并保留升级和买关键牌的预算。可通过正常购买、升级推进秘技进度，按已取得的秘技和来牌判断后续打法。","separator":"\n\n","id":"n-256f3d22905dee5deb74"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"title":"适用打法与选择","space":" ","separator":"\n\n","id":"n-131e1eecc08143e80d2f"},{"type":"entry","key":"河洛花木兰","show_key":true,"value":"必须阵营：河洛。 关键成员：花木兰、上官婉儿、程咬金、武则天、李白。 定阵条件：1）河洛开放，过渡能保血，花木兰与供币组件有获取机会。 主要英雄：花木兰集中等级和装备，上官婉儿优先觉醒。 核心机制：花木兰依靠古币增加本轮复生次数，在反复承伤和复生中维持输出。上官婉儿与程咬金负责整备用币，武则天补手牌古币，李白提高用币后的临时等级。武凤的开局和拍卖后额外能量可以用于保血、升本和购买核心，这些支出同时推进为我所用。复制到能补牌或重复触发整备的秘技时，可以加快核心觉醒或补当轮复生。秘技存在随机性，常规成长由河洛英雄与古币完成。 优势：拍卖后额外能量帮助补核心，实用秘技可以进一步增加供牌或整备次数。 短板：秘技随机，婉儿未觉醒时用币效率较低。 阶段强度：前期用额外能量补战力；中期找花木兰和整备英雄；后期按对手压力分配古币、整备牌和保护装备。 可能变阵：同局其他转阵条件尚待确认。","prefix":"","key_suffix":"：","separator":"\n\n","id":"n-4bdf9761af0a1a5206f4"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"title":"适用技巧","space":" ","separator":"\n\n","id":"n-5208573a05d575b03c23"},{"type":"entry","key":"先按实际秘技决定用途","show_key":true,"value":"拿到能复制英雄的秘技时，先整理复制候选，优先补仍缺觉醒的河洛核心。拿到能重复打牌的秘技时，先补上官婉儿觉醒，再兑现整备。","prefix":"","key_suffix":"：","separator":"\n\n","id":"n-895050bc2362fdeec43b"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"title":"关联知识","space":" ","separator":"\n\n","id":"n-ee66f32548b2c8177a85"},{"type":"entry","key":"正文","show_key":false,"value":"[河洛花木兰-武凤](../lineups/河洛花木兰-武凤.json)","separator":"\n","id":"n-94ef655391c6be518839"}]},"claim_annotations":[{"id":"n-3dc9d341e37e2161a429-claim","text_ref":"n-3dc9d341e37e2161a429","section":"技能","kind":"conditional_strategy","evidence":[{"type":"video","source":"BV1sh4B6SE7a:p1","start":0,"end":33},{"type":"video","source":"BV1fzWb6rED6:p1","start":26.7,"end":83.2}],"inference":true},{"id":"n-b3c064851071819d80b2-claim","text_ref":"n-b3c064851071819d80b2","section":"技能","kind":"conditional_strategy","evidence":[{"type":"video","source":"BV1sh4B6SE7a:p1","start":0,"end":33},{"type":"video","source":"BV1fzWb6rED6:p1","start":26.7,"end":83.2}],"inference":true},{"id":"n-b6fa03aef894538f2262-claim","text_ref":"n-b6fa03aef894538f2262","section":"技能","kind":"conditional_strategy","evidence":[{"type":"video","source":"BV1sh4B6SE7a:p1","start":0,"end":33},{"type":"video","source":"BV1fzWb6rED6:p1","start":26.7,"end":83.2}],"inference":true},{"id":"n-256f3d22905dee5deb74-claim","text_ref":"n-256f3d22905dee5deb74","section":"前期思路","kind":"conditional_strategy","evidence":[{"type":"video","source":"BV1fzWb6rED6:p1","start":83.2,"end":112.5},{"type":"video","source":"BV1fzWb6rED6:p1","start":166.2,"end":249},{"type":"video","source":"BV1fzWb6rED6:p1","start":311.98,"end":346.79}],"inference":true},{"id":"n-4bdf9761af0a1a5206f4-claim","text_ref":"n-4bdf9761af0a1a5206f4","section":"适用打法与选择","kind":"conditional_strategy","evidence":[{"type":"video","source":"BV1sh4B6SE7a:p1","start":0,"end":33},{"type":"video","source":"BV1fzWb6rED6:p1","start":26.7,"end":83.2},{"type":"video","source":"BV1fzWb6rED6:p1","start":83.2,"end":112.5},{"type":"video","source":"BV1fzWb6rED6:p1","start":166.2,"end":249},{"type":"video","source":"BV1fzWb6